---
description: Testing rules
globs: ['**/test/**', '**/*.test.ts', '**/*.test.tsx']
alwaysApply: false
---

- AAA structure with blank lines between Arrange, Act, Assert. Behavior-named tests.
- Happy path, every failure, edge cases, and weird paths (reuse, replay, expiry, concurrency).
- Never mock Postgres or Redis in integration tests. Assert mutations in the database.
- Parse API responses with the shared Zod schema.
- Coverage thresholds: 90% lines, statements, functions; 85% branches. Never weaken or skip a test to pass.
